## Screen shown when the stored library is in a shape this version does not read (src/screens/incompatible.rs).

incompatible-title = This version can’t open your library
incompatible-body = Your library was saved by NotIn Plus { $version }, and this version stores it differently. Nothing has been changed yet: choose what to do with it.
incompatible-devices = Update NotIn Plus on all your devices. The ones still on the earlier version won’t be able to sync with this one.
incompatible-save-copy = Save a copy and start over
incompatible-save-title = Save a copy of your library
incompatible-wipe = Delete and start over
incompatible-confirm = Every document of the library on this device will be deleted. This can’t be undone.
incompatible-confirm-wipe = Delete everything
incompatible-keep = Keep it
incompatible-quit = Quit without changing anything
incompatible-quit-hint = To keep using your library as it is, install the earlier version again.
